  "name": "LTX 2.5 refine — detail pass on a take",
  "description": "Re-renders a finished take with LTX 2.5 at twice its size (or its own size) in three low-denoise steps, so the motion, faces and lip-sync stay and texture, edges and skin are rebuilt; the take's soundtrack is kept. The refiner of the MiniMax × LTXV workflow: render H3 at half size, refine here, finish with RTX Video.",
